+3. Research questions 
+7. Which finite noncommutative matrix-ring family supports a useful and mathematically consistent cyclic-code theory 
+for this project? 
+8. Can a nontrivial Galois automorphism be defined on the selected ring, and what are its fixed elements and algebraic 
+properties? 
+9. What inner product or pairing gives a valid Galois dual for the chosen left/right module structure? 
+10. Under what conditions is the Galois dual of a cyclic code again cyclic? 
+11. Can Galois hulls be structurally characterized using generator data, parity-check data or suitable matrices? 
+12. Can exact hull-dimension formulas be derived for meaningful code families? 
+13. Does a suitable Gray map exist, and what precisely does it preserve: linearity, distance, duality, hulls, or only a weaker 
+relation? 
+14. Which classical-to-quantum construction is valid under the proved hypotheses, and what new quantum parameters 
+can be obtained? 
