+### A3. Dinh, Gaur, Kumar, Singh & Singh (2024)
+* **Title:** Cyclic codes over rings of matrices
+* **Authors:** Hai Q. Dinh, Atul Gaur, Pratyush Kumar, Manoj Kumar Singh,
