+# PHASE 6 — QUANTUM PARAMETER ENHANCEMENT, EXACT DISTANCE CERTIFICATION AND NOVEL CODE CONSTRUCTION
+
+**Status:** complete (Tasks A–I).  Every statement below is labelled
+**PROVED** (a proof is given in this file), **COMPUTATIONALLY VERIFIED ONLY**
+(the statement is checked exhaustively or on a seeded sample, no proof),
+**IMPORTED RESULT** (taken from the literature with a citation),
+**CONJECTURE**, **OPEN**, or **REFUTED**.
+
+**Companion artefacts**
