+
+**Dependencies (read-only, never modified in this phase):** all of Phases 0–4,
+and `PHASE5_QUANTUM_CONSTRUCTIONS.md` (the three routes R1/R2/R3, T-193 … T-203,
+and the open problems O-5.1 … O-5.6 which this phase addresses).
+
+**What Phase 6 does.**  Phase 5 produced 17 codes with best distance `d = 3`
+and left six open problems.  Phase 6 (i) searches the *same* framework
+systematically and exactly, (ii) certifies the distance of every reported code
+by three independent methods, (iii) re-derives the O-3.1 witnesses from the
+enumeration instead of from a table, (iv) determines the exact domain of the
+characteristic-two obstruction, and (v) performs the literature comparison
+that O-5.4 declared impossible offline.
