+      L6  {Hermitian Gram} = {reflexive}            : True   (|H|=6, |R|=6, |H n R|=6)
+      L1  LCD (Hull = 0)                            :  30/30
+      L2  LCD whose dual is LCD                     :  30/30
+      L3  self-orthogonal / self-dual               :   1 /   0
+      L4  reflexive (C^{perp perp} = C)             :   6/30
+      (assertion '(C^perp)^perp = sigma_{2s}(C)' held for all 30 codes)
+
+done
