+  `τ ∈ Aut(A_t)` one has `θ_τ² = τ²`, `(C^⊥)^⊥ = τ²(C)` and reflexivity ⟺ `τ² = id`, but
+  the general case is undeveloped, and by T-030 `Aut(A_t) ⊋ {σ_s}`.
