+F.  comparison with the literature (offline, no code tables
+-----------------------------------------------------------
+  accessible from this environment)
+  - Quantum MDS: N - K = 2(d-1) is met by [[N,N-2,2]]_q for every N
+    (take k = 1).  Grassl-Beth-Roetteler-type tables are NOT
+    reachable here, so no claim of record parameters is made.
+  - The constructions are new only in their ORIGIN (Galois hulls of
+    cyclic codes over the non-commutative ring M_2(F_q[u]/u^t) via
+    the Gray map), not necessarily in their parameters.
+  - Structural comparison: Gray images of cyclic codes over
+    commutative chain rings are quasi-cyclic and duality is
