+PHASE 7 -- EXTENDED SEARCH: OPTIMAL QUANTUM PARAMETERS, ENTANGLEMENT
+EFFICIENCY, AND THE STRUCTURE OF THE ATTAINABLE FRONTIER
+===========================================================================
+
