+    say("M_2(F_2) = F_4 + u F_4  (u^2 = 0) is  C = (f h) + u (f g)  with")
+    say("x^n - 1 = f g h  a factorisation into pairwise coprime polynomials")
+    say("over F_4.  For n = 3 there are 3^3 = 27 such triples.")
+    say()
