+### P15-1 (was CP-1) — the "three independent methods" overclaim
+
+**Status: CORRECTED.**
+
+The manuscript claimed that the 28 certified codes are certified by *three
+independent methods*. That is false, and the committed data contradict it.
+`supplementary/scripts/phase7_extended_search.py`, `part6_certification`
+(lines 1664–1708), runs
+
+```
+d1, comp1 = enum_min_weight(...)          # M1
+if comp1:
+    d2, m2 = None, "n/a (M1 already complete)"   # M2 NOT RUN
+else:
+    d2, _  = min_weight_in(...)                   # M2 run instead
+```
+
+so **M2 is executed only when M1 fails to complete**. Consequently:
