+
+**m-1. The earlier tuple $[[24,4,5;12]]_4$ changed value.**
+Phase 6 reported it from a 300-code sample of $(4,2,3)$. Exhaustive
+enumeration of that family (35 937 codes) gives best EA distance $6$, attained
