+\title{Quantum Error-Correcting Codes from Galois Hulls of Cyclic
+       Codes over Noncommutative Matrix Rings}
+% Author line. Single author: the affiliation is indicated by a lowercase
+% superscript letter immediately after the name and in front of the address,
+% exactly as the FFA guide for authors requires.
+\author{\AUTHORONE\textsuperscript{a}}
