+
+## 7. Status
+
+**CORRECTED — applied in the staging copy only.**
+The canonical `PAPER/main.tex` abstract is **unchanged**. The revision lives in
+`PAPER/FFA_SUBMISSION_STAGING/main.tex` and compiles cleanly (see
