+
+**Hypotheses.** `B` commutative finite; `S = M_2(B)`; `W ⊆ B²` a `B`-submodule;
+`I_W = {M : im M ⊆ W}`.
+
+**Statement (individual).**
+(a) `μ_S(I_W) = ⌈μ_B(W)/2⌉` ( = P-2.3(2) );
+(b) `I_W` is **principal** `⟺ μ_B(W) ≤ 2`;
+(c) `I_W` is generated by `2` elements whenever `μ_B(W) ≤ 4`.
