+F1.  ERRATUM E-7.1 -- the EA bookkeeping identity of Phase 6 O-6.1
+------------------------------------------------------------------
+  Phase 6, section 12, open problem O-6.1, states:
+      'the entanglement grows with d (c + K = N - k)'.
+  That identity is WRONG.  With k = dim D, h_E = dim(D n D^{perp_E}),
